# SchemeAssist AI – Project Overview

SchemeAssist AI is an AI-powered Government Scheme Recommendation System
designed to help citizens discover relevant government schemes based on
their personal and socio-economic profile.

## Problem Statement
Citizens often lack awareness and clarity about government schemes.
Manual search is time-consuming and confusing.

## Solution
An AI-driven system that analyzes user profile data such as income,
state, age, and category to recommend eligible schemes with explanations.

